2
00:01:39,043 --> 00:01:41,500
君に…
To you...

3
00:01:50,152 --> 00:01:53,602
君に出逢えなかったら
If I hadn't met you,

4
00:01:53,942 --> 00:01:59,602
僕は何をしていたのかわからない
I wonder what I would have been doing.

5
00:01:59,982 --> 00:02:01,622
どうしてなんだろう
I wonder why that is.

6
00:02:01,812 --> 00:02:10,502
今日はなぜかたまらないほど泣きたくなるんだ
Today, for some reason, I feel like crying so much I can hardly bear it.

7
00:02:11,812 --> 00:02:21,232
夕暮れの風に吹かれて二人でずっと話したあの夏に
In that summer when we talked on and on, blown by the twilight wind,

8
00:02:21,522 --> 00:02:31,252
心から僕はただ本当の恋をしたんだね
From the bottom of my heart, I truly fell in love, didn't I?

9
00:02:31,822 --> 00:02:41,762
君を守る強さをもっとあれば僕は君を幸せにできるのかな
If I had more strength to protect you, could I make you happy?

10
00:02:42,082 --> 00:02:51,852
愛することと信じることの意味が今わかったら二人で乗り越えられる
Now that I understand the meaning of loving and believing, we can overcome it together.

11
00:02:52,532 --> 00:03:03,502
君がいてくれて本当に良かったこの手をつないで握りしめて満たされていく
I'm so glad you were here with me. Holding hands tightly, I feel so fulfilled.

12
00:03:03,852 --> 00:03:09,612
二人の指先は明日を指差す
Our fingertips point toward tomorrow.

13
00:03:09,852 --> 00:03:16,212
あふれる気持ちが未来にほら向かっているよ
Look, our overflowing feelings are heading toward the future.

14
00:03:26,512 --> 00:03:35,842
君が教えてくれたねちっぽけでささやかな幸せたち
You taught me about those small, modest pieces of happiness, didn't you?

15
00:03:36,042 --> 00:03:45,902
いつの間にか君のこと誰よりも愛していたんだ
Before I knew it, I had come to love you more than anyone else.

16
00:03:46,032 --> 00:03:57,232
隣でいつも君がいて笑ってるそれだけで僕はただ幸せなんだ
You're always by my side, smiling—just that alone makes me truly happy.

17
00:03:57,552 --> 00:04:06,062
切なさに似たもどかしさを抱えていた逃げないでまっすぐ届けてみるよ
I was holding onto an impatience resembling sadness; without running away, I'll try to reach you.

18
00:04:07,512 --> 00:04:18,812
時に壊れそうで震える想いが君を傷つけてしまうよどうしようもない
Sometimes my trembling feelings, feeling as if they might break, end up hurting you.

19
00:04:19,032 --> 00:04:29,512
追い越せない太陽流れていく雲大好きな気持ち一つまた増えていったよ
The sun we can't overtake, the passing clouds—my feelings of love grew by one more.

20
00:04:51,352 --> 00:04:59,212
バカ騒ぎしてた帰り道ビルに消えていく青い月
On our way home from making a ruckus, the blue moon fading into the buildings.

21
00:05:00,330 --> 00:05:02,140
友人と恋愛はどう違う？
What is the difference between friendship and love?

22
00:05:02,140 --> 00:05:05,800
いつになく君が熱く語っていた
You talked about it passionately, more than usual.

23
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,100
後からみんなに言われたんだ
Afterwards, everyone told me:

24
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:09,920
どうして お前が気づいてあげないのか
"Why didn't you notice her feelings?"

25
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,760
ごめんね 僕がよそ見してて…
Forgive me for looking away...

26
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:15,660
なんだか 胸の奥がざわつく
For some reason, my heart is racing deep inside.

27
00:05:16,490 --> 00:05:17,620
南風
The south wind...

28
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:19,470
走れ！Bicycle
Run! Bicycle

29
00:05:19,470 --> 00:05:20,980
急げ！恋
Hurry up! Towards love!

30
00:05:20,980 --> 00:05:22,960
全力でペダル漕ぐ
I'm pedaling with all my might.

31
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,760
寂しくさせてしまった 君に追いつきたい
I left you alone unintentionally. Now I want to catch up.

32
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:28,030
走れ！Bicycle 風になれ！
Run! Bicycle, become like the wind!

33
00:05:28,030 --> 00:05:32,490
先を歩く運命を 振り返らせてみたい
The fate that ran ahead, please turn back to me.

34
00:05:32,490 --> 00:05:35,350
僕も君が好きなんだ 両想い
Actually, I am also in love with you. It is mutual love.

35
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:38,280
駅前の混雑のロータリー
At the crowded roundabout in front of the station,

36
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:41,230
君を乗せたバスが今やっと着く
the bus that you are riding on is finally arriving.

37
00:05:41,230 --> 00:05:44,260
最後のスパート 立ち漕ぎで
With only a few pedal strokes left,

38
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:46,070
君の名前をここから呼んでみる
I started shouting your name aloud.

39
00:05:46,070 --> 00:05:48,320
今さら どんな顔をしようか？
It's a bit late, how should I approach you now?

40
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:51,370
ホントは 僕も告りたかった いつからか
Truthfully, I wanted to confess too since who knows when.

41
00:05:51,370 --> 00:05:53,960
止まれ！Bicycle もう一度
Stop! Bicycle, once more,

42
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:56,600
時の針巻き戻し
rewind the hands of time.

43
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,740
呼吸は乱れていても
Even though I am out of breath,

44
00:05:58,740 --> 00:06:01,400
君に向き合おう
I will face you.

45
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:21,090
はーい、みなこんに… 今の雰囲気ぶち壊しやな(笑)
Hi everyone, konni... That totally ruined the mood, lol.

46
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:31,260
はい、ということで、みなさん新ビジュアル3Dきました！ 本当にどうもお待たせいたしました！
So, everyone, the new 3D visual is here! Thank you so much for waiting!

47
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:35,420
みてみて、どう？かわいいでしょ？
Look, look, how is it? Cute, right?

48
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:45,400
みてみて、いっぱい、あの、下からとかも撮ってもらったんですけど、ちょっとじっくり見てほしいなって思ったりでも時間もそんなにないので
They took photos from below and all, but since we don't have that much time to look closely...

49
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:55,780
あの、後でね、ちょっとあの、とある人たちをゲストに呼びましたんで、そこでもね、撮影会をしたいなと思っております。
Later on, we invited some people as guests, so we'd like to do a photo session there too.

50
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:59,820
ていうか、季節、ガン無視つってな。
I mean, completely ignoring the season, lol.

51
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:05,910
ま、でもね、バーチャル地方なんで、バーチャル地方はちょっと早めの春が来ております。
Well, it's a virtual region, so virtual regions get an early spring.

52
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:12,760
4月誕生日なんでね、ま、ちょっと春なんだと思います。
My birthday is in April, so I guess it's spring.

53
00:07:13,130 --> 00:07:27,770
いや、今回はですね、あの、カッコいい曲も結構用意させていただいていまーす。あの、みんなが好きな曲とか、盛り上がる曲とか、楽しい曲とか、たくさん用意させていただいておりますので、
Anyway, this time we prepared quite a few cool songs. Songs everyone likes, hype songs, fun songs, we prepared lots of them,

54
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:32,490
みんなも一緒に盛り上がってくれたら嬉しいです！
so I'd be happy if everyone gets hyped together with me!

55
00:07:32,590 --> 00:07:40,390
ま、ちょっとね、私、あの、喋るのがめっちゃ、あの、歌枠とかの時もそうなんですけど、歌うとね、喋りベタになってしまうので、
Well, when I sing, I tend to get bad at talking,

56
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:50,090
ま、ちょっとトーク短めかも知れませんが、この後もね、いっぱい楽しんでいただけたらなと思います。
so my talk might be a bit short, but I hope you enjoy the rest as well.

57
00:07:50,190 --> 00:08:07,140
余すところなくね、あの、写真撮って欲しいです。あの、ハッシュタグどっちに出るかな？こっちかな？ちょっとこっちに、あの、ハッシュタグぜひ、あの、ここに載ってるやつをいっぱいツイートしてスクショ撮ってくれたら嬉しいです！よろしくお願いします！
Please take lots of photos without missing anything! Which side does the hashtag appear on? Please tweet and take screenshots with the hashtag displayed here!

58
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:19,390
いっぱい撮ってね！いろんな歌で、あの、歌うので、ポーズもいっぱい取るので、いっぱいいっぱい写真撮ってください！お願いします！
Take lots of pictures! Since I'll sing various songs and strike lots of poses, please take tons of photos! Please!

59
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:36,530
じゃあちょっと、次の曲もね、あの、この桜並木せっかくなので、ここで歌おうかなって思っています。ぜひぜひみなさん最後まで聞いてくださいね！ていうことで、よろしくお願いします！
Well then, since we're at this cherry blossom avenue, I'm thinking of singing the next song here. Everyone, please listen till the very end! So, thank you!

60
00:08:39,130 --> 00:08:49,808
でわ、最後の、最後の曲じゃないわ、始まったばかりや。次の曲に行きたいと思います。ダヴィンチの告白。
Well then, the last... wait, it's not the last song, we just started! Let's move on to the next song: "Da Vinci's Confession".

61
00:09:00,330 --> 00:09:03,960
どんなに有名でも伝えきれない
No matter how famous it is, I can't convey it.

62
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:07,750
こんなに高価絵画描いてんのにわかんねーのか
Such a refined portrait I have painted, and yet do none of you get it?

63
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:10,960
盤石の宗教裁判 世知辛い イン・エミネッティ
The rock-solid inquisition, a tough world, in eminenti.

64
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:14,060
円満な解決法は これからさ
The perfect solution has yet to come.

65
00:09:14,060 --> 00:09:16,900
散々なお目に遭いました
I went through a lot.

66
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:20,108
自首マニアリズムににあやかって
Adopting the maniacal martyrdom,

67
00:09:20,108 --> 00:09:23,008
「全部が僕の罪と罰です。」
claiming, "The crime and punishment are all mine."

68
00:09:23,008 --> 00:09:26,508
偽りめの愛を愛そう
Let's adore this false affection.

69
00:09:26,508 --> 00:09:28,990
簡単な役 演じきって
Playing a role, a simple part,

70
00:09:28,990 --> 00:09:32,408
「困難な道を歩んだ。」って
proclaiming, "I've taken the thorny path,"

71
00:09:32,408 --> 00:09:35,490
起伏のない白黒映画は耐えられないさ
in a black-and-white film with no tension is unbearable.

72
00:09:35,490 --> 00:09:37,960
la la liar...

73
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,960
存在革命 剥がれて
Stripping away the existence revolution,

74
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:42,508
la la liar...

75
00:09:42,508 --> 00:09:44,208
風景を再生確認
Rewind the scenery.

76
00:09:44,208 --> 00:09:46,508
la la liar...

77
00:09:46,508 --> 00:09:49,008
iq 迷宮 just like you
IQ maze, just like you.

78
00:09:49,008 --> 00:09:52,508
la la liar...

79
00:09:52,508 --> 00:09:55,308
この世界の片隅 丸くなってた
This corner of this world, just rounded off,

80
00:09:55,308 --> 00:09:58,508
ありふれた顔に嫌気差して
and disgust streaked their mundane faces.

81
00:10:00,213 --> 00:10:04,933
聞いて こんなの誰にもありえないって
Listen... no one could ever experience something like this,

82
00:10:05,116 --> 00:10:09,816
現実のままでいま見ず知らずなんだ
staying in reality as strangers right now.

83
00:10:17,066 --> 00:10:23,916
ランデブーなんてあてにならない 信じられるのは自分だからそりゃそうだろ
Rendezvous and the like cannot be relied upon; the only one you can believe in is yourself, so of course that's how it is.

84
00:10:24,416 --> 00:10:31,916
情動的な先入観で 秘密の地球を 放浪という箱に押し込めて
With emotional preconceptions, pushing our secret Earth into a box called wandering.

85
00:10:47,216 --> 00:10:54,516
恋い慕いて醒めたら 愛なんて忘れるさ 敗者になって後悔したって 縦に流されて
Yearning for love, once I wake up, I'll forget about love. Even if I become a loser and regret it, being swept vertically,

86
00:10:55,116 --> 00:11:02,116
敗者になって深呼吸を眺める 優越感を抱いて教科書に乗ってなんて夢見るの
becoming a loser and looking at deep breaths, harboring a sense of superiority, dreaming of being in a textbook.

87
00:11:04,316 --> 00:11:09,516
戦場 生き残れ生存方法で 幽霊を蘇生 不動界
Battlefield, survive with survival methods, resurrecting ghosts in the immovable world.

88
00:11:18,516 --> 00:11:23,516
この世界の片隅で 誰かが泣いていた 無力な自分を見てるようだ
In a corner of this world, someone was crying, looking like my powerless self.

89
00:11:27,216 --> 00:11:35,816
この先60年を勇敢に生きて 感覚のままでいま見ず知らずなんだ
Bravely living the next 60 years, staying true to my senses as a stranger right now.

90
00:11:47,516 --> 00:11:51,016
恋い慕いて醒めたら 愛なんて忘れるさ
Yearning for love, once I wake up, I'll forget about love.

91
00:12:07,148 --> 00:12:12,768
お待たせ！準備はいいか？ 今日はみんなで騒ぎましょう！せーの！
Sorry to keep you waiting! Are you ready? Let's make some noise together today! Ready, go!

92
00:12:25,090 --> 00:12:29,490
やってきました みんなに会える時間です
The time to finally meet everyone has come!

93
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:33,740
ちょっとゲームとか見てほしくて
I wanted you to see things like games and—

94
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:38,950
ごめんね まさかあっという間にすぎてしまう
Sorry, but before I knew it, time passed by so fast—

95
00:12:38,950 --> 00:12:46,090
間に一瞬に乗り遅れないように手をつなごう
so let's hold hands so we don't miss a single moment!

96
00:12:48,350 --> 00:12:53,660
気づけば隣にいてくれてありがとう
Thank you for being right by my side before I knew it.

97
00:12:54,510 --> 00:13:02,010
どんな高い壁だってひとっ飛びで飛び越えて 誰も見たことない世界にみんなで行こうよ
Let's leap over any high wall in a single bound and go together to a world nobody has ever seen!

98
00:13:03,970 --> 00:13:09,150
キミとSmile & Go! 楽しんだもん勝ち
You and Smile & Go! The one who enjoys it wins.

99
00:13:09,450 --> 00:13:14,670
キミとSmile & Go! はじけたもん勝ち ここに笑顔であつまれば最高でしょ
You and Smile & Go! The one who pops with joy wins. If we gather here with smiles, it's the best!

100
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:22,110
ぼくらSmile & Go! いつも全力で ぼくらSmile & Go! 遊びまくろうだって
We are Smile & Go! Always going all out. We are Smile & Go! Let's play to our hearts' content, because...

101
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:27,770
この日常が大切な宝物だよ
this everyday life is a precious treasure.

102
00:13:29,410 --> 00:13:31,130
Smile & Go!

103
00:13:43,156 --> 00:13:47,346
雑談配信今日はまったりいきましょう
Today's chat stream is going to be relaxed and cozy.

104
00:13:48,176 --> 00:13:54,686
他愛ない話聞いてほしくて
I wanted you to listen to some trivial talk—

105
00:13:55,236 --> 00:14:03,926
たまにはお休みしようと思ったけれど やっぱり万全開新死いじゃおうかな
I thought about taking a break for once, but maybe I'll go all out with a fresh spirit instead!

106
00:14:05,486 --> 00:14:12,796
ありふれたこの時も一緒に過ごしたら いつも間にかキラキラと 何よりも輝いて 言葉にはできない想いが溢れ出していったよ
Even this ordinary time, when spent together, suddenly shines brighter than anything before, overflowing with feelings words can't express.

107
00:14:20,606 --> 00:14:25,606
キミとLet's Enjoy! 確かめ合おうよ
You and Let's Enjoy! Let's confirm it together.

108
00:14:25,606 --> 00:14:28,926
キミとLet's Enjoy! 心はひとつ どこにいたって優しさは届いてるよ
You and Let's Enjoy! Our hearts are one. No matter where you are, kindness reaches you.

109
00:14:33,436 --> 00:14:37,756
ぼくらLet's Enjoy! テンション上げてさ ぼくらLet's Enjoy! はしゃぎまくろう
We are Let's Enjoy! Raising our tension. We are Let's Enjoy! Let's party it up to the max!

110
00:14:40,866 --> 00:14:47,706
明日はもっと楽しいこと待っているから まってるよ！
Tomorrow even more fun things are waiting for us, so I'll be waiting!

111
00:14:51,936 --> 00:14:59,056
みんな！お披露目盛り上がってますか？ かわいくなった私を余すところなく…
Everyone! Is the reveal hype going strong? Take in every last bit of the cute new me...

112
00:15:00,344 --> 00:15:01,344
こんにー！準備はいいー！
Hello! Are you ready?!

113
00:15:01,464 --> 00:15:02,524
今日はみんなで騒ぎましょう！
Let's get excited together today!

114
00:15:02,684 --> 00:15:03,124
せーの！
Ready, set!

115
00:15:08,544 --> 00:15:09,984
3, 2, 1, ゴー！
3, 2, 1, go!

116
00:15:22,584 --> 00:15:26,584
ずっと見ていて 私のことを
Keep watching over me...

117
00:15:27,084 --> 00:15:30,084
これから先も 期待していてね？
And look forward to what's ahead, okay?

118
00:15:31,024 --> 00:15:35,024
予測不能なワクワクを キミに送るから
Sending unpredictable excitement straight to you!

119
00:15:39,904 --> 00:15:41,884
君とsmile & go!! 楽しんだもん勝ち
With you, smile & go!! Having fun is winning,

120
00:15:42,084 --> 00:15:44,404
君とsmile & go!! はじけたもん勝ち
with you, smile & go!! Bursting with energy wins.

121
00:15:45,044 --> 00:15:48,584
ここに笑顔で集まれば 最高でしょ
It's the best when we gather here with smiles!

122
00:15:49,024 --> 00:15:51,284
僕らsmile & go!! いつも全力で
We, smile & go!! Always giving our all,

123
00:15:51,544 --> 00:15:54,424
僕らsmile & go!! 遊びまくろう
we, smile & go!! Let's play to our heart's content.

